{"id":"nirgendwo","lemma":"nirgendwo","pos":"adv","rank":1323,"glosses":["nowhere (in no place)"],"ipa":"/ˈnɪʁɡn̩tvoː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/De-nirgendwo.ogg/De-nirgendwo.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich konnte es nirgendwo finden.","en":"I couldn't find it anywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717861","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to find"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen nirgendwo hingehen.","en":"We don't have to go anywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718049","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Nirgendwo ist es sicher.","en":"Nowhere is safe.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"safely"}]},{"text":"Ich wäre nirgendwo lieber.","en":"There's nowhere else I'd rather be.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"}]},{"text":"Ich wohne irgendwo im Nirgendwo.","en":"I live in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},{"g":"somewhere"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}